      "description": "CAN YOU SPOT IT?\n\nOdd One Out is a fast-paced visual puzzle game designed to test your observation skills on your wrist.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n\nLook at the grid of icons (e.g., Thumbs Up ).\n\nFind the ONE icon that is slightly different (e.g., Thumbs Down ).\n\nTap it before the timer hits zero!\n\nWHY PLAY?\n\nTrain Your Focus: Sharpen your attention to detail.\n\nInfinite Levels: The game gets harder as you go.\n\nInstant Fun: Perfect for 30-second breaks.\n\nClean Visuals: Beautiful neon icons on a black background.\n\nProve you have the best eyes on the leaderboard. Download Odd One Out now!",
